WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.410
S4 Presents: It's Our Job to Shine.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:16.950
We'll be your hosts.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:20.450
The four glimmering stars, S4!

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.750
Everyone, Merry Christmas!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.580
Reel it in, Yuzu. Christmas is still a ways away.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.380
You're getting ahead of yourself.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:32.720
Come on! I'm so excited for Christmas I can't hold back!

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:38.470
And Tsubasacchi, I saw that tiny tree you looked so happy to stick on your desk.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.850
You don't need to bring that up here!

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:43.350
'Tis the season for...

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.770
Sparkling Stars Christmas!

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.110
That's S4's Christmas concert.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:52.860
All the tickets got sold out within a minute!{not again... wait, this is a legitimate use of within}

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.860
Everyone, thanks so much!

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:59.160
The concert will be streamed live on Aikatsu TV.{tasty}

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:04.750
Even if you couldn't get a ticket, we still welcome you to spend your Christmas with us!{I'd say Christmastime extends quite a bit further than actual Christmas and its immediate surrounds}

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:09.380
We're looking forward to seeing all of you there!

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:26.020
A Christmas party will grace these halls on Christmas Eve, courtesy of us admins. {are you high?}

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:31.020
Worry not, as we'll be streaming S4's concert live.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.860
All students of Four Star Academy are welcome.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:38.030
We eagerly await your attendance.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.490
I wonder what kind of Christmas party it'll be!

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:45.370
It's awesome that we'll get to see S4 live!

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:46.910
I'm super hyped for it!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.420
Rola, we should hold a Christmas concert too!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:54.050
Huh?

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.510
I don't just want to watch their concert at the party.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.180
I want to do something myself!{sure, make this all about you}{Yummy is the main character!}

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.180
Yume, you've changed.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:09.100
Normally, you'd be the first one to say you wouldn't miss S4 for anything.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.560
This time, I can't fight the urge to do something.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:16.940
I have my senpai, my rival, and my friends.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.070
Realizing that made me really happy.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:23.830
Now I'm just welling up with motivation!

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.450
Christmas is all about self-producing too.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.330
I get that.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.210
Want to hold a Christmas concert with me, Rola?

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:34.960
That gets me going!

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.550
I'm starting to feel the excitement!

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.090
Our goal is Christmas! Let's go!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.280
A Christmas concert?

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:21.150
Yep, just with us!

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:26.620
It'll be the same day as S4's, so there's no telling if people will actually come.

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:28.280
But we still wanna do it!

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.330
Are you in?

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.010
There it is, the brick break!{fine you pokemon memer}

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.430
And she used way more than usual!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:50.560
The thought of watching my sister on stage while I sat idle was getting on my nerves!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.680
I'll gladly join you!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.140
That's what I like to hear!

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.940
Okay, next!{what are you, indian?}

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.940
I must refuse.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:03.650
Aw, but why?

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.860
To give the blatantly obvious answer, it's because it's Christmas Eve!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.660
Read the mood!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.080
I will be spending the Eve with my beloved Subaru-kyun...

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.000
Ako.

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.460
Subaru-kyun.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.720
You mean Subaru from M4? Are you two dating?

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.050
We are... not in a relationship yet...

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.470
Then you must at least have a date with him.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.520
We have made... no such plans.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:37.270
So basically, you're doing nothing and hoping for the best.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.360
Wh-What is the problem with that?!

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.820
Nothing!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.400
It's important to have dreams and aspirations, Ako-chan.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.910
Alas, I cannot bring myself to ask Subaru-kyun about his plans...

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.330
Let's go ask him right now then!

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:52.830
Huh?

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:14.770
Aikatsu!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.770
All right, that should do for a warmup.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:25.400
Not like it's any different this time, 
but isn't this too intense just for a warmup?

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.280
We even have a gig right after.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:31.280
It's exactly because we've got work that we need to get pumped up now.

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.660
We've got a tough schedule this month.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.540
There are drama recordings, magazine interviews, and New Year's shows to attend.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.420
We also have to rehearse for our Christmas concert.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:45.000
So it's work all the way through Christmas.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.670
Wish I could see Koharu-chan.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.430
Work comes first.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.090
We need to build M4's fame and reputation.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.680
There are heaps of things left to do.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.930
We don't have time for romance.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:07:00.190
Love isn't something you do, it's something you fall in.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:06.570
Just thinking of her smile or voice makes your heart race.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:10.450
This exhilaration and joy can't be replaced by anything else!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.490
I haven't got a clue what you're on about. Right, Kanata?

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:15.620
I'm on Nozomu and Asahi's side.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.450
Seriously?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:20.620
According to my analysis, all work and no play leaves you boring and featureless.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.710
A person's individuality comes from their outside passions.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.250
Romance is one part of that.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.710
Wait, but...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:32.470
Can someone who's never been in love ever touch a person's heart through his performances?

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.970
It's about time. Let's go.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.140
Romance, huh.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:40.890
Hey!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:41.890
Wait!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.110
Hey, what are your plans for Christmas Eve?

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:47.190
Huh?

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.740
Wait, are you...

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:53.490
Asking Subaru-kun out for Christmas?

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:58.240
It's not that. One of my friends was 
wondering what M4 was doing that day.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:03.000
We've got work from dawn to dusk on Christmas Eve.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.460
<i>As expected of my Subaru-kyun!</i>

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.750
<i>His passion for work is so wonderful!</i>

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.510
What have you got planned?

00:08:11.510 --> 00:08:13.550
We're about to figure that out.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:17.640
First and foremost is our Christmas concert! And then...

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:21.020
We'll hold a present exchange with the passersby!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.850
Do you really expect every single person walking by to have presents?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:25.810
Oh yeah?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:29.110
It's a bird!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:30.280
It's a plane!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.070
No!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.700
It's Yume Santa!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:37.320
I'll become Santa Claus and surprise everyone with my magic sleigh!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:40.450
Where are you going to find reindeer?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:41.500
Somewhere around there.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.710
Around where is what we're asking.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.210
In any case, real reindeer don't fly.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.000
Can't we get them up there somehow?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.840
Yume-chan's got a vivid imagination, if nothing else.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.550
How cute!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:56.010
Either way, it's impossible.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.550
Who cares about that?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.970
There's no point in doing the same thing everyone else does.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:02.770
Motivation is all you need.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.350
And I'm overflowing with it!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.150
Good luck.

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.650
You too.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.780
Subaru-kyun, go for it!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.950
Looks like you're totally free now, Ako-chan.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.950
Let's perform together, okay girl?{...}

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.040
It appears I must concede.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.830
If you want me that much, I suppose I will.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.000
Yay!

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.840
Why did you jump on me?!

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:32.420
Come on, Ako-chan! Time's a-wasting!{as the research}

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.300
What?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:37.180
Self-producing for Christmas!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:40.220
That's what I like to hear from my Four Star students!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.100
Thank you!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:45.180
But Christmas Eve is going to be tough.

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:50.110
All the likely venues are already 
filled up, including the Academy.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:52.610
We won't get anywhere unless we can find a place.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.740
This might be too difficult.

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:59.530
How about the plaza in the shopping district?

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.620
Can that place even host a concert?

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.500
As long as you get permission, it should be doable.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.460
Then let's go ask!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:08.960
Sensei, thanks for the advice!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.630
Wait, Yume!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.880
She's fast!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.550
Stop right there!

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:17.130
Yume!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:20.300
You've taken off now, Nijino.

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:42.160
If our plaza is enough for you, then please feel free.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.200
Thank you.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:48.000
I'm sure the customers will enjoy it.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:54.960
That's part of it, but I also want all of the shop owners and workers to have fun too.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:59.220
My family runs a confectionery shop.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:01.510
We're always swamped for Christmas.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:09.310
That's why I want to deliver a Christmas song to everyone who can't go to a party due to work and such.{should be "can't go to a party because of work or other circumstances" but that's long}{I sorta parsed it differently}

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.440
Great idea!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:15.820
How wonderful! It would make all of us here very happy.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.900
Look forward to an exciting Christmas concert!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.340
I made Christmas cards as flyers.{where does aegisub's dictionary come from anyway}

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.340
Wow, Mahiru-chan. You've got great taste.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.840
Let's make a whole bunch and hand them out!

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.840
Yeah!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:44.850
Y-Yeah...

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.860
Aikatsu!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.860
Aikatsu!

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.110
Ai—

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:04.740
The axe!{I misheard "otoshita no wa kin no ono deshita" as "otoshita no wa kinou no deshita" for a long time}

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:10.080
It's a school tradition to fell a fir with an axe for our Christmas tree...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.750
But now...

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.050
A chainsaw?!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.510
It is important to uphold tradition.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:33.190
Nevertheless, at times it is necessary to advance those traditions!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.030
Good afternoon!

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:48.450
We're going to hold a concert on Christmas Eve!

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:51.040
Please come watch!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.210
Hey, isn't that Nijino Yume-chan?

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.540
And Rola-chan!

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.710
Mahiru-chan, you're so pretty!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:01.050
Ako-chan, I watch your drama! Please shake my hand!

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:05.470
We're going to perform in a live concert just for Christmas Eve.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:07.590
Please come to see us!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:16.310
These Four Star Academy first-years will be holding a Christmas concert, babies!

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.280
There we go.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.620
There are so many people.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:21.420
We reeled in a much larger audience than I expected.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.630
Yume, what are you looking at?

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.760
I just noticed how nice that was.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.430
It's huge. What's in this?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.810
It was just delivered express.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.480
Looks kind of like a Christmas present...

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.190
Merry Merry Christmas! {fuck yeah!}

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.690
It's you!

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:47.070
Haruka☆Luka!

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:52.450
Didn't you go to study dance abroad in Los Angeles after Yuzu-sama won that dance battle?

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:03.130
Haruka came back for a surprise visit so that nobody'd forget about her!{at least all the way}

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.090
Return! Return!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.380
We would never forget you.

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:09.590
More like we <i>couldn't</i> forget about you.

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:13.140
Now that Haruka's here, let's get this party started.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:15.600
Let Four Star Academy's Christmas party...

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.520
Start!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:40.870
We're all set!

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.460
We are stars.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:47.250
The Four Stars that light up the Aikatsu world.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.970
Tirelessly serving as shining beacons in the sky.

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.880
The radiance of S4 is...

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:54.430
Eternal!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.560
Now, our princesses await us.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.520
Let's go!

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:14.910
Let's deliver our Christmas song to everyone!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.410
Sakuraba Rola. It's our time to shine!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.660
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.670
Saotome Ako, making her dazzling entrance!

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.170
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.650
We did it!

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.530
Snow...

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.200
It's a white Christmas!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.450
How pretty.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.410
Thank you.

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:47.450
Thanks!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.450
That concert was fantastic!

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.220
It's freezing!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.470
I'm tired.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.680
I think we all are.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.770
Wow!

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.100
Yeah.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.810
Let's go check it out!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.230
Hey!

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:21.280
Are you done with work?

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:26.120
Yeah. How'd your self-produced Christmas concert go?

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:30.700
What, did it not pan out?

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.870
Nope, it was a huge success.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.840
I gave it my full effort, and everyone liked us too.

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:42.380
But I can't help but feel like there must've been something more I could've done.

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:46.220
I was thinking the same thing.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:51.810
My fans and friends say we were great, but I'm still not satisfied.

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:56.100
I end up thinking that it could been more amazing, more impressive.

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:57.520
Me too.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.440
That's what I want to be.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:08.030
The first star, shining higher than everyone, and brighter than anyone else.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.620
The first star, huh.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.540
Looks like you have a long way to go, then.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.580
I know that already.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.920
But I'm gonna make it!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.550
Yume!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.300
I'm coming!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.130
See you.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.510
Hey, watch your—

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:36.520
Hey, could you get off me?

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:39.690
You're kind of heavy.

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:41.110
Sorry!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.900
Thanks, Subaru-kun!

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.160
Huh, what's wrong?

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:53.580
You're bright red.

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:57.830
Boiled octopus.

00:21:58.420 --> 00:21:59.670
Shut it!

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:02.170
Bye! And Merry Christmas!

00:22:03.760 --> 00:22:05.670
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.970
Love isn't something you do, it's something you fall in.

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:14.060
Just thinking of her smile or voice makes your heart race.

00:22:14.680 --> 00:22:17.100
<i>No, there's no way.</i>

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:20.060
<i>I don't have time for romance...</i>

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:23.570
I can't contain my excitement!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:12.840
It's almost New Year's!

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:14.180
So what should we play?

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:15.680
We've got work!

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:18.640
Let's at least go on the first shrine visit together...

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:20.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:22.190
Aikatsu New Year.

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:24.400
Become the first-star idol!
